    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151090/extras/c9284de439ea3d45999e353d293a42ec.avif?t=1575833210\" /></div><br><br>Two teams, up to 8 players, compete to capture the Easter Egg while defending their team with abilities. The time limit for a match is 5 minutes. There are two goals; capturing the Easter Egg, then bringing it back to the home while defending your teammates.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151090/extras/ef8bbfd4db4d6fb2112c278d0482b6b0.avif?t=1575833210\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two unique character types and as equal gameplay features,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Competitive Gameplay,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different game modes such as Ranked, Quick or Private Match,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2-8 player,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Level &amp; Ranking,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Awesome forest design, completely equally designed for both teams,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Day, Night and Sunset,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Boosting and Power-Ups for both character type,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You can set up a party to join matches with friends,</li></ul><br><strong>Power-Ups for both character type such as:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Freezer</strong> is freezing the opposite team players for 3 seconds.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Lightning</strong> makes a lightning cloud that is striking to the opposite team players for 3 seconds.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Anvil</strong> is to creating anvil on the back of the opposite team players for slowing down 8 seconds.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Power Shield</strong> is to create a powerful shield that protects the player against power-ups for 15 seconds.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Purify Power</strong> is purifying power-up effects on the player.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Egg Bomb</strong> Explode the Easter Egg and stun the opposite team player which is carrying or near the Easter Egg.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Double Up</strong> Double up the Easter Egg and gain 2 scores instead of 1 when bringing it back to the home in 20 seconds.</li></ul><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151090/extras/8b106aa8a7d966b3cc3f18a4d7b7a72f.avif?t=1575833210\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More Maps,</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Character customization,</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different game modes,</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Playing against AI,</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More language support.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151090/extras/c9284de439ea3d45999e353d293a42ec.avif?t=1575833210\" /></div><br><br>Two teams, up to 8 players, compete to capture the Easter Egg while defending their team with abilities. The time limit for a match is 5 minutes. There are two goals; capturing the Easter Egg, then bringing it back to the home while defending your teammates.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151090/extras/ef8bbfd4db4d6fb2112c278d0482b6b0.avif?t=1575833210\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two unique character types and as equal gameplay features,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Competitive Gameplay,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different game modes such as Ranked, Quick or Private Match,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2-8 player,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Level &amp; Ranking,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Awesome forest design, completely equally designed for both teams,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Day, Night and Sunset,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Boosting and Power-Ups for both character type,</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You can set up a party to join matches with friends,</li></ul><br><strong>Power-Ups for both character type such as:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Freezer</strong> is freezing the opposite team players for 3 seconds.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Lightning</strong> makes a lightning cloud that is striking to the opposite team players for 3 seconds.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Anvil</strong> is to creating anvil on the back of the opposite team players for slowing down 8 seconds.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Power Shield</strong> is to create a powerful shield that protects the player against power-ups for 15 seconds.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Purify Power</strong> is purifying power-up effects on the player.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Egg Bomb</strong> Explode the Easter Egg and stun the opposite team player which is carrying or near the Easter Egg.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Double Up</strong> Double up the Easter Egg and gain 2 scores instead of 1 when bringing it back to the home in 20 seconds.</li></ul><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151090/extras/8b106aa8a7d966b3cc3f18a4d7b7a72f.avif?t=1575833210\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More Maps,</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Character customization,</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different game modes,</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Playing against AI,</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More language support.</li></ul>",
